  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Country Strategic Plan - 2014/15 - 2019/20</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 6 month internal project for the development of South Sudan Country Strategic Plan (CSP) to guide and inform the country planning and programming between FY 2014/15 to 2019/20. The process will involve partner and stakeholder consultations including joint workshops with CAFOD staffs. The country team will be supported by one external facilitator from UK formerly CAFOD staff and also the head of programme effectiveness in the HQ. The CSP process will be concluded with a formal launch event in Juba.</narrative>
  </description>
